    "chunk_text": "UK Sanctions on four Sri Lankans\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-04-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- The attention of the Cabinet was drawn to the recent decision taken by the United Kingdom to impose sanctions on 04 Sri Lankans. The Cabinet decided to appoint a Ministerial Committee with the following composition to examine the above matter and submit a Report with recommendations to the Cabinet on the future action to be taken and to authorize the Committee to co-opt the serv\u00ecces of any other officer/expert with expertise in the relevant subject matter deemed necessary for its deliberations:\n\n*\tHon. Vijitha Herath\n\u00a0 Minister of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism\n\n*\tHon. Harshana Nanayakkara (Attorney-at-law)\n\u00a0 Minister of Justice and National Integration\n\n*\tHon. Aruna Jayasekara\n\u00a0 Deputy Minister of Defence"
