    "chunk_size_bytes": 876,
    "chunk_text": "Appointment to a Post of Additional Secretary of the Prime Minister's   Office\n\nPress briefing of Cabinet Decision taken on 2025-04-01 (Subject to Confirmation at the next Meeting)\n\n- Five (05) posts of Additional Secretary of the Special Grade of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service have been approved for the Prime Minister's Office, of which three (03) are currently vacant. Mr. A.B.M. Ashraff, Special Grade Officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, currently serving as a Management Specialist for the Green Climate Fund of the United Nations Development Programme for Sri Lanka, has been identified as suitable to be appointed to a said vacant post of Additional Secretary.  Considering the proposal submitted by the Hon. Prime Minister accordingly, Cabinet decided to appoint him as an Additional Secretary in the Prime Minister's Office, with immediate effect."
