    "description": "Signing the Agreement related to the Protocol for Exporting Poultry Meat to the Chinese Market",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=12986",
