    "description": "Amendment to the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262)",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.cabinetoffice.gov.lk/cab/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=16&Itemid=49&lang=en&dID=7750",
